@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

concise "User" as U
concise "OcrTranslateScreen" as OS
concise "OCRService" as OCR
concise "OCR API" as API
concise "TranslationService" as TS

@0
U is Idle
OS is Idle
OCR is Idle
API is Idle
TS is Idle

@100
U is Selecting Image
OS is Processing

@200
OS -> OCR: Extract Text
OCR is Processing

@300
OCR -> API: Send Request
API is Processing

@400
API -> OCR: Response
OCR is Parsing

@500
OCR -> OS: Extracted Text
OS is Tokenizing

@600
OS -> TS: Translate Word 1
TS is Translating

@700
TS -> OS: Translation 1
OS is Processing

@800
OS -> TS: Translate Word 2
TS is Translating

@900
TS -> OS: Translation 2
OS is Displaying

@1000
U is Viewing Results
OS is Displaying Results

@enduml
